<title>UK: UK Ecu notes due 2000 highest yield 4.19 pct.</title>
<headline>UK Ecu notes due 2000 highest yield 4.19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said on Tuesday its auction of 500 million Ecu of notes due 2000 was oversubscribed and the highest accepted yield was 4.19 percent.  </p>
<p>The Bank said 1.553 billion stg of notes was applied for. The lowest accepted yield was 4.16 percent and the average yield on the notes allotted was 4.1823 percent.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 6784</p>
</text>
